---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer — FormSetu">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">Disclaimer</h1>
  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">Last updated 31 July 2026</p>

  <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <div class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-amber-500 bg-amber-100 p-4">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-navy-900">FormSetu is not a government website</h2>
      <p class="mt-1">We are an independent, privately operated site. We are not affiliated with, authorised by, endorsed by, or connected to the Staff Selection Commission, UPSC, Railway Recruitment Boards, IBPS, any State Public Service Commission, or any other government body or examination authority.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Always use the official source</h2>
    <p>Information on this site is compiled from publicly available official notifications and is provided for convenience only. It is not a substitute for the official notification. Every exam page links to the relevant official website — check there before you apply.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">No guarantee of acceptance</h2>
    <p>Our tools produce files matching the specifications we have recorded. We cannot guarantee any portal will accept a given file, and we accept no responsibility for a rejected application or document.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">We do not provide jobs or results</h2>
    <p>We do not offer employment, guarantee selection, process applications, or provide examination results. We will never ask you for payment in exchange for a job, a result, or an application.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Names and trademarks</h2>
    <p>Examination names and organisation names are used only to identify which requirements a page describes. All trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p>

    <p class="pt-2">Found something inaccurate? Tell us at <a href="mailto:contact@formsetu.com" class="font-semibold text-navy-700 underline">contact@formsetu.com</a> and we will correct it.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>